# Local agent bridge (`.odc/local/`)

If `.odc/local/` exists, **read it** before acting (`STATUS.md`, `RUN.md`, `HUB.md`, `LINKS.md`).

## This repo (`web`)

- Owns site, editor, curriculum, `emulator/r2/` **browser shell**.
- Emulator **core** is `~/github/emulator` — rebuild WASM via `emulator/r2/scripts/deploy-web.sh`.
- Browser firmware path: Firebase via `?projectID=` (Lab → Simulate). No manual `.bin` upload on the page.
- Localhost may use `sample.bin` only as smoke test.

## Hub

Map/contracts: `~/github/hub`. After flow changes, update hub docs or write `.odc/local/HUB.md`.

Never commit `.odc/local/`.
